{"suttaId":"an7.31","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-vii","vriCode":"s0403m3.mul","paras":[188,208],"vripara":"31"},"segments":{"an7.31:0.3":"Parābhavasuttaṃ","an7.31:1.1":"“Sattime, bhikkhave, upāsakassa parābhavā … pe …","an7.31:1.2":"sattime, bhikkhave, upāsakassa sambhavā.","an7.31:1.3":"Katame satta?","an7.31:1.4":"Bhikkhudassanaṃ na hāpeti,","an7.31:1.5":"saddhammassavanaṃ nappamajjati,","an7.31:1.6":"adhisīle sikkhati,","an7.31:1.7":"pasādabahulo hoti,","an7.31:1.8":"bhikkhūsu theresu ceva navesu ca majjhimesu ca anupārambhacitto dhammaṃ suṇāti na randhagavesī,","an7.31:1.9":"na ito bahiddhā dakkhiṇeyyaṃ gavesati,","an7.31:1.10":"idha ca pubbakāraṃ karoti.","an7.31:1.11":"Ime kho, bhikkhave, satta upāsakassa sambhavāti.","an7.31:2.1":"“Dassanaṃ bhāvitattānaṃ,","an7.31:2.2":"yo hāpeti upāsako;","an7.31:2.3":"Savanañca ariyadhammānaṃ,","an7.31:2.4":"adhisīle na sikkhati.","an7.31:3.1":"“Appasādo ca bhikkhūsu,","an7.31:3.2":"bhiyyo bhiyyo pavaḍḍhati;","an7.31:3.3":"Upārambhakacitto ca,","an7.31:3.4":"saddhammaṃ sotumicchati.","an7.31:4.1":"“Ito ca bahiddhā aññaṃ,","an7.31:4.2":"dakkhiṇeyyaṃ gavesati;","an7.31:4.3":"Tattheva ca pubbakāraṃ,","an7.31:4.4":"yo karoti upāsako.","an7.31:5.1":"“Ete kho parihāniye,","an7.31:5.2":"satta dhamme sudesite;","an7.31:5.3":"Upāsako sevamāno,","an7.31:5.4":"saddhammā parihāyati.","an7.31:6.1":"“Dassanaṃ bhāvitattānaṃ,","an7.31:6.2":"yo na hāpeti upāsako;","an7.31:6.3":"Savanañca ariyadhammānaṃ,","an7.31:6.4":"adhisīle ca sikkhati.","an7.31:7.1":"“Pasādo cassa bhikkhūsu,","an7.31:7.2":"bhiyyo bhiyyo pavaḍḍhati;","an7.31:7.3":"Anupārambhacitto ca,","an7.31:7.4":"saddhammaṃ sotumicchati.","an7.31:8.1":"“Na ito bahiddhā aññaṃ,","an7.31:8.2":"dakkhiṇeyyaṃ gavesati;","an7.31:8.3":"Idheva ca pubbakāraṃ,","an7.31:8.4":"yo karoti upāsako.","an7.31:9.1":"“Ete kho aparihāniye,","an7.31:9.2":"satta dhamme sudesite;","an7.31:9.3":"Upāsako sevamāno,","an7.31:9.4":"saddhammā na parihāyatī”ti.","an7.31:9.5":"ekādasamaṃ;","an7.31:9.6":"Vajjisattakavaggo [vajjivaggo (syā.)] tatiyo.","an7.31:10.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an7.31:10.1":"Sāranda -vassakāro ca,","an7.31:10.2":"tisattakāni bhikkhukā;","an7.31:10.3":"Bodhisaññā dve ca hāni,","an7.31:10.4":"vipatti ca parābhavoti."},"unsure":[],"attha":null,"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-vii","bookName":"Sattakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":859,"to":863,"paras":[{"para":859,"vripara":"27-31","refs":["an7.31:1"],"lines":["27-31. Sattame aniccāti anupassati etāyāti <b>aniccānupassanā</b>.","Tathāpavattavipassanā pana yasmā attanā sahagatasaññāya bhāvitāya bhāvitā eva hoti, tasmā vuttaṃ <b>“aniccānupassanādīhi sahagatasaññā”</b>ti.","Imā satta lokiyavipassanāpi honti “aniccan”tiādinā pavattanato.","“Etaṃ santaṃ etaṃ paṇītaṃ yadidaṃ sabbasaṅkhārasamatho”ti āgatavasena panettha dve lokuttarā hontīti veditabbā.","“Virāgo nirodho”ti hi tattha nibbānaṃ vuttanti idha virāgasaññā, tā vuttasaññā nibbānārammaṇāpi siyuṃ.","Sesamettha suviññeyyameva.","Aṭṭhamādīni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an7.31:1"],["an7.31:1"],["an7.31:1"],["an7.31:1"],["an7.31:1"],["an7.31:1"],["an7.31:1"]]},{"para":860,"vripara":null,"refs":["an7.31:1"],"lines":["Saññāsuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an7.31:1"]]},{"para":861,"vripara":null,"refs":["an7.31:1"],"lines":["Vajjisattakavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an7.31:1"]]},{"para":862,"vripara":null,"refs":["an7.31:1"],"lines":["Devatāvaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an7.31:1"]]},{"para":863,"vripara":null,"refs":["an7.31:1"],"lines":["Paṭhamamittasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an7.31:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
